    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "creation(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->[deity0_name]创造了众多种族，每个种族都是[deity0_possessive]完美形象的不同体现。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)  ->我们的生物学家将[deity0_name]的众多造物编目归档，使[deity0_objective]感到欣慰。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "intro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->在[place_summary][place_name]，[memberNamePlural]发现了[deity0_name]的教诲，展现出真正的开明。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "conflict(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->仇视异族的[foeLeader]鄙视[memberNamePlural]群体的包容，[foeLeader_possessive][foeSoldiers]用[place_personalWeapon]摧毁了他们的大厅。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->一位名叫[founderName]的机敏[place_job]请求其他种族帮助，警告[memberNamePlural]注意[foeSoldiers]正在逼近。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "victory(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->[founderName]遵照[deity0_name]的神圣旨意传播包容与爱，将[memberNamePlural]中的各族团结起来，击败[foeSoldiers]。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "setup(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->行星殖民早期，[founderName]是一名社会科学家。看到许多政府极端排外的政策，[founder_pronoun]乘小型飞船离开，创立[founder_possessive]自己的运动。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->[founderName]召集杰出的科学家和社会学家，建立让所有种族和谐共处的新文明。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->我大学里最年长的社会学家教给我宇宙生命的历史，指出"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lesson(tag=meme_Xenophilia)              ->我们并不孤独。群星之间并不缺少智慧生命，我们皆如兄弟姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->只有并肩合作、暂放彼此差异，才能完成任何任务。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->还有什么比统一的、超越奇点的超凡科技更能接纳我们内在的差异？"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->在超越之中，我们的生物起源逐渐融为一体。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->[inTheEnd]，我们所有人都将通过合作实现升华。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->精灵之间没有“种族”的概念。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->当我们完全接纳彼此、将彼此视作同一纯粹理念的不同体现时，精灵便会向我们揭示本质。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "排异族主义"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "不容异族存活，他们的存在本身就威胁着我们。他们更适合成为我们的仆役或食物。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.generalRules.rulesStrings.0",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "memeAdjective->偏执"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.generalRules.rulesStrings.1",
