    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "creation(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->[deity0_name]创造了我们，作为[deity0_possessive]神圣形象的完美体现。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)  ->[deity0_name]的其他造物只是为我们制作的工具；将他们视为工具正是[deity0_objective]的旨意。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "intro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->在[place_summary][place_name]，[memberNamePlural]发现了[deity0_name]的教诲，确认我们居于造物之巅。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "conflict(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->嫉妒我们神圣地位的异族[foeLeader]试图征服[memberNamePlural]群体，[foeLeader_possessive][foeSoldiers]奴役了我们的人民。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->奴隶中出现了一位名叫[founderName]的机敏[place_job]，组织[memberNamePlural]反抗异族压迫者。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "victory(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->[founderName]遵照[deity0_name]的神圣旨意屠灭异族，将[memberNamePlural]带入进步与优越的新时代。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "setup(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->行星殖民早期，[founderName]是一名社会科学家。看到许多政府愚蠢的接纳政策，[founder_pronoun]乘小型飞船离开，创立[founder_possessive]自己的运动。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->[founderName]召集杰出的科学家和社会学家，建立将本族需求置于可憎异族之上的新文明。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->小队里最年长的猎人教给我宇宙生命的历史，指出"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lesson(tag=meme_Xenophobia)              ->我们并不孤独。群星之间并不缺少智慧生命，而他们的存在本身就威胁着我们。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->别无选择，必须清除异族威胁。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->超凡科技是生物进化的顶峰，只有真正配得上它的人才应抵达。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->你能想象失控的异族后奇点智能会对我们构成怎样的威胁吗？"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->别无选择，必须在异族获准达到那种境界前清除他们。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->异族没有灵魂，是精灵世界的污秽之物。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "MemeDef",
      "text": "animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->只有清除所有异族，精灵才会眷顾我们。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "IssueDef",
      "text": "异族"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Abhorrent.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "深恶痛绝"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Abhorrent.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "异族休想与我们成为朋友。他们只想让我们灭亡，我们不能容忍他们在身边。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Abhorrent.stages.0.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "ThoughtDef",
      "text": "恶心的异族！"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Abhorrent.stages.0.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "ThoughtDef",
      "text": "其他种族令人极其厌恶，我无法忍受他们！"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Abhorrent_Social.stages.0.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "ThoughtDef",
      "text": "恶心的异族！"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Horrible.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "不喜欢"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Horrible.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "异族与我们不同，差异太大。我们必须保持警惕，与他们保持距离。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Horrible_Social.stages.0.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "ThoughtDef",
      "text": "不信任异族"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Standard.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "中立"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Standard.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "外来的异族与我们并无高低之分。"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Respected.label",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
      "text": "尊重"
    },
    {
      "key": "HAR_AlienRaces_Respected.description",
      "kind": "DefInjected",
      "defType": "PreceptDef",
